The AI RMF to ISO/IEC 42001 crosswalk
-------------------------------------

scripts/build_crosswalk.py reads the crosswalk that Microsoft provided and NIST's
AI Resource Center lists,
https://airc.nist.gov/docs/NIST_AI_RMF_to_ISO_IEC_42001_Crosswalk.pdf. NIST's
listing says inclusion implies no endorsement. The document states no licence and
quotes ISO's headings, so this repository carries neither the document nor its
pairs. The script writes them under tmp/, which git ignores, for the person who
runs it. ISO/IEC 42001 is copyright ISO and IEC, and no text of it is reproduced
here.

